OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of raping student
OL,4,Ain his home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of raping a
OL,7,Fstudent after luring her to his home in
OL,8,FLeeds.
OL,10,FUvesh Vahora, 36, had denied attacking
OL,11,Fthe woman on 9 April, claiming he had
OL,12,Fmet her in the street and taken her to
OL,13,Fhis home in the Hyde Park area after
OL,14,Foffering her the use of his toilet.
OL,16,FA trial at Leeds Crown Court heard the
OL,17,Fwoman, who cannot be named for legal
OL,18,Freasons, had taken ketamine and had no
OL,19,Fmemory of how she had met Vahora,
OL,20,Ftelling jurors she had been
OL,21,F"intoxicated" and "disoriented".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
